  "notes": "Housed in a gatefold sleeve.\n\nThis edition has the following text beneath the barcode on the reverse:\n\"Jeepster Recordings, No. 60 Canalot Production Studios, 222 Kensal Road, London W10 5BN\"\n\"Distributed by 3MV/Vital\"\nPressing plant uncredited, identified by unique pressing ring and runouts.\n\nUnlike UK Reissues from 2009 onwards which feature a PO box address and Universal Music distribution credit.\n",
